
| Directory | Purpose                                                |
| --------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |
| `/`       | Root directory (top of the filesystem)                 |
| `/home`   | Home directories for users                             |
| `/root`   | Home directory of the root user                        |
| `/etc`    | System configuration files                             |
| `/var`    | Variable data (logs, caches, mail, databases)          |
| `/tmp`    | Temporary files                                        |
| `/opt`    | Optional third-party software                          |
| `/usr`    | User applications and libraries                        |
| `/bin`    | Essential user commands                                |
| `/sbin`   | System administration commands                         |
| `/dev`    | Device files (eg. disk, speakers, flashdrive, keyboard)|
| `/proc`   | Virtual filesystem with process and kernel information |
| `/boot`   | Bootloader and kernel files                            |
| `/mnt`    | Temporary mount point                                  |
| `/media`  | Removable media (USB, CD-ROM)                          |
